          "content": "改善案A — 設計意図",
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yG2bX",
          "name": "意図1",
          "fill": "#9aa1af",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1. 状態の内訳はチーム／メンバーを分離（個人課題とチーム課題を混同しない）",
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cE4UM",
          "name": "意図2",
          "fill": "#9aa1af",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2. 過去比較は週次Journal感情トーンの件数を4週積み上げ棒で。さっと見る用途なので3列目の狭い枠に置く",
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "J2h7pL",
          "name": "意図3",
          "fill": "#9aa1af",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3. チェックイン未記録は上部の薄い帯。リッチな締めくくりカードは朝の主問いから外す",
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FVsVo",
          "name": "意図4",
          "fill": "#9aa1af",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. 今日やるべき3つは順位・なぜ今・緊急度・動詞CTAで立体化",
          "fontFamily": "Zen Kaku Gothic New",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
